msgid "Custom script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Custom Script addon allows you to inject a custom JavaScript file "
"into your documentation at serve time. This enables you to modify or "
"enhance frozen documentation without rebuilding it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-script.rst:8
msgid "Configure custom scripts"
msgstr ""

